Local changes:
- Native headers, 6c/mk builds and one shared window loop in game.c.
- Fixed logical arena with aspect-preserving rendering and mouse mapping.
- Native command-line options, screenshot capture and R to restart.
- UpdateGame reports whether it needs timed frames. The shared loop uses
  raylib event waiting while paused or game over, except in fixed-frame tests.
- Restart resets pause and round counters; no browser or desktop main loop.
- Initialize Arkanoid's ball radius before positioning it.
- Place Arkanoid's pause message below the bricks so it remains legible.
- Stop a spent Asteroids shot from hitting the fragments it just created.
- Reject Missile Commander shots outside the arena or at the launcher itself;
  a missile that has hit a building cannot also score an interception.
- Reinitialize explosion slots through one shared function, advance every
  interceptor each frame, and shrink explosions to zero before expiry.

These games draw only geometry and raylib's built-in font. There are no
external game assets, sound files, shaders or additional runtime libraries.
